   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF aids prevention</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF aids prevention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEFs project The Right to Know in Bosnia, Macedonia, Serbia and Montenegro aims at prevent the spread of HIV/AIDS. They work with and for young people, providing them with information and lifeskills via media, theater, TV, yough friendly services, peer education etc. 1,5 years.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEFs projekt The Right To Know i Bosnien, Serbien/Montenegro och Makedonien syftar till att hindra spridningen av HIV/AIDS och arbetar med och f&#xf6;r ungdomar:informationsinsatser genom media, i skolor, ungdomsmottagningra mm. 1,5 years.</narrative>
  </description>
